  "topic": { "id": "function-design", "order": 1, "title": { "zh": "函数设计", "en": "Function Design" } },
  "title": {
    "zh": "写一次，到处使用",
    "en": "Write It Once, Use It Again"
  },
  "concept": {
    "zh": "函数名、参数和返回值",
    "en": "Function names, parameters, and return values"
  },
  "brief": {
    "zh": "把重复的计算封装成函数，用不同参数调用它。",
    "en": "Put a recurring calculation in a function and call it with different arguments."
  },
  "hints": [],
  "execution": {
    "source": "def charge_gap(current, target):\n    return target - current\n\ncharge = scan()\nfirst = charge_gap(charge, 8)\nsecond = charge_gap(charge, 10)\nsay(str(second))",
    "cases": [
      {
        "label": { "zh": "起始电量 2 格", "en": "Start with 2 units" },
        "input": 2,
        "expected": "8"
      },
      {
        "label": { "zh": "起始电量 5 格", "en": "Start with 5 units" },
        "input": 5,
        "expected": "5"
      }
    ]
  },
  "sections": [
    {
      "title": {
        "zh": "用函数给一段计算起名",
        "en": "Give a calculation a function name"
      },
      "body": {
        "zh": "def 声明一个函数。调用函数时，括号里的值变成参数，函数用 return 把结果交回来。换一组参数，就能再做一次同样的计算。",
        "en": "Use def to define a function. A call passes values into its parameters, and return sends the result back. Call it with new values to do the same calculation again."
      }
    },
    {
      "title": {
        "zh": "给参数起能说明用途的名字",
        "en": "Choose names that explain the parameters"
      },
      "body": {
        "zh": "例如 charge_gap(current, target) 需要当前电量和目标电量。参数名能提示调用者该按什么顺序传值。",
        "en": "For example, charge_gap(current, target) needs the current and target charges. The names help callers pass values in the right order."
      }
    },
    {
      "title": {
        "zh": "接住返回值",
        "en": "Use the returned value"
      },
      "body": {
        "zh": "调用者可以用一个变量接住结果，还可以把结果交给另一个函数。用多组参数检查同一个函数。",
        "en": "The caller can store the result in a variable or pass it to another function. Test the same function with several sets of arguments."
      }
    }
  ],
  "question": {
    "prompt": {
      "zh": "函数 double(n) 返回 n * 2。先调用 double(3)，再调用 double(5)，依次得到什么？",
      "en": "A function double(n) returns n * 2. What do double(3) and then double(5) return?"
    },
    "options": [
      {
        "zh": "6、6",
        "en": "6, 6"
      },
      {
        "zh": "3、5",
        "en": "3, 5"
      },
      {
        "zh": "6、10",
        "en": "6, 10"
      }
    ],
    "correct": 2,
    "feedback": {
      "zh": "每次调用都拿到自己的参数。第一次用 3 乘 2，第二次用 5 乘 2。",
      "en": "Each call has its own parameter. The first multiplies 3 by 2 and the second multiplies 5 by 2."
    }
  },
